Subject: [PATCH] controller: allow registration without redundant fleet queries

Keep AddUnassociatedStation's default collection behavior. An opt-in NBAPI
boolean registers native radio/STA state without launching a query for every
registered station. The client then explicitly requests one fresh collection.
This avoids quadratic query bursts while retaining native result timestamps,
registration validation, and legacy BML/NBAPI behavior.

